COMPILATION OF: E52E

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E52E

   1 a 0000 E52E:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-52/P1] NON-SHADOWED OUTER WRITE: only main declares o
   4 a 0006      fixed dec(9,2); the nested procedure q stores o = 3. Compiles
   5 a 0006      on MINE today (flat map contains o). The row tests the
   6 a 0006      ACCUMULATION half of the fix: a prescan carrying only each
   7 a 0006      procedures OWN rows would see no o inside q, miss the 5-byte
   8 a 0006      target-precision cell, and shift every later DATA address.
   9 a 0006      Predicted DR pool 5 + o cell 5, DATA 10. */
  10 c 0006   dcl o fixed dec(9,2);
  11 c 0006   call q;
  12 c 0009   q: procedure;
  13 e 0009      o = 3;
  14 c 001D      end q;
  15 a 001D end E52E;

CODE SIZE = 0020
DATA AREA = 000A
FREE SYMS = 38B2
END  COMPILATION
